			description: [
				"Welcome to §dHonkai Impact III-GTL §r. Your civilization has reached the MAX voltage of GT technology, but that's just the prologue."
				""
				"On top of MAX, there are four new stages: §dAbyss §r, §dImaginary Number §r, §dQuantum §r, §dFinal §r, and eventually your civilization will accept the final judgment."
				""
				"§eCore instructions:"
				"§71. The multi-block machine §fof this module does not require an energy warehouse §7. It will automatically bind to the nearest player when it is formed, and the EU will be directly deducted from your wireless network - please make sure there is power in the power grid."
				"§72. A large number of recipes and machines are gated by the §fresearch system §7, and subsequent tasks will guide you to build a research matrix."
				"§73. The more powerful a civilization is, the more it will be watched §f§7- Too much attention will slow down the research speed, learn to manage it."
			]
